Hello Tom,=C2=A0
=C2=A0
Apologies for the delays on this, it took time to recreate the fault. We
managed to do so on a Minimus manually set back to the 29th December 2025 a=
nd
found the issue to be on the script-side, resulting from a buffer delay. I
attached to this email a revised script created by my colleague Joe. You ca=
n
save it as a .py and run it from the command line like:
=C2=A0
python Manual_Download.py 10.20.1.82 2025-12-30 0 96 --net DG --station 0A5=
55
--loc 0L --channels HHZ,HHN,HHE --output C:\Users\jmatthewson\Documents\Mse=
ed
=E2=80=93combine
=C2=A0
You can find more details in the new scripting manual section, attached, wh=
ich
also contains a Bash version.=C2=A0
=C2=A0
Kind regards,
Krystian.
